            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "@fabz-fr Could you please share your `mini.deps` configuration? The GitLab link currently looks like this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal add = MiniDeps.add\r\nadd({\r\n  source = 'https://gitlab.com/user/repo',\r\n})\r\n```\r\n",
